By gorging yourself on up to [3, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] stacks of Bleak Outcome from a creature, you turn into an Ominous Shadow for one turn per stack.

While transformed you are invisible (power [40, 54, 65, 74, 82 (TL1-5; SP 100)]), convert 100% of all damage done to darkness and gain darkness resistance penetration and damage increase equal to your highest.

While transformed you can not apply new Bleak Outcome stacks.
